Pasal 12
Dalam melaksanakan kewajiban dan tanggungjawabnya Pemerintah Daerah  berwewenang:
a. membuat kebijakan dan program;
b. merumuskan pedoman pelaksanaan;
c. menyelenggarakan layanan;
d. mengkoordinasikan kebijakan, program, anggaran dan layanan; e. melakukan monitoring, supervisi dan evaluasi terhadap penyelenggaraan  perlindungan pencegahan korban kekerasan terutama bagi perempuan,  anak dan keluarganya.

translated_text:
Article 12
In carrying out its obligations and responsibilities, the Regional Government has the authority to:
a. make policies and programs;
b. formulate implementation guidelines;
c. provide services;
d. coordinate policies, programs, budgets and services; e. conduct monitoring, supervision and evaluation of the implementation of protection and prevention for victims of violence, especially for women, children and their families.

